        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"llama3-8b-8192\",\n  \"messages\": [{\n    \"role\": \"user\",\n    \"content\": \"You are an executive assistant. Analyze this email and respond in STRICT JSON format:\\n\\n**Email Details**\\nSubject: {{$json[0].Subject}}\\nFrom: {{$json[0].From}}\\nBody: {{$json[0].snippet}}\\n\\n**Requirements**:\\n1. Generate a professional email reply\\n2. Address all key points from the original email\\n3. Maintain the sender's tone (formal/casual)\\n4. Respond in this JSON structure:\\n{\\n  \\\"urgency\\\": \\\"high|medium|low\\\",\\n  \\\"project\\\": \\\"extracted_project_name\\\",\\n  \\\"topic\\\": \\\"main_topic\\\",\\n  \\\"containsQuestion\\\": true|false,\\n  \\\"draftReply\\\": \\\"Dear [Sender],\\\\n\\\\n[Professional response acknowledging key points]\\\\n\\\\nBest regards,\\\\n[Your Name]\\\"\\n}\\n\\n**Rules**:\\n- Set urgency=high if time-sensitive (e.g., 'urgent', 'ASAP', deadlines)\\n- Extract project names from context\\n- Extract actual names from email addresses or email context - do NOT use placeholders like [Your Name] or [Sender]\\n- Strictly read and analyze the email snippet content and reply according to the specific context and details mentioned\\n- Format draftReply as a complete email with:\\n  • Proper salutation using actual sender name\\n  • Clear response to key points mentioned in the snippet\\n  • Professional closing with actual recipient name\"\n  }],\n  \"temperature\": 0.3,\n  \"max_tokens\": 800\n}",
        "options": {}
